// Rejects: a modifier the declaration it's on doesn't read
//
// `public`, `comptime`, `unsafe` and attributes were parsed in front of any
// declaration and dropped by the ones that don't use them, so `comptime
// struct`, `unsafe enum` and `public import` all compiled and meant nothing.
// Re-exporting a name is `export`.

// ERROR: a struct isn't compile-time or not [E0100]
comptime struct Point { x: i32 }

func main() {}
